1 0 0 1 48 690 Tm (== VISUAL SUMMARY ==) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 677 Tm (Five takeaways to remember about weather logs and reasonable extension requests. Use them as) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 664 Tm (a one-page briefing before you write or speak.) Tj
