1 0 0 1 48 638 Tm (* Make the decision point explicit: Your appeal should answer whether to request a weather-based extension with exhibits, not adjectives.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 625 Tm (* Compare options deliberately: Know whether you are closer to Documented storm delay, Mild weather, or Vendor backlog only before you escalate.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 612 Tm (* Write one remedy sentence: Boards skim-state waive, reduce, re-notice, or reverse in a single line tied to weather logs and reasonable extension requests.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 599 Tm (* Keep escalation proportionate: Match collections risk and dollar amount to mediation, counsel, or court only after the packet is complete.) Tj
