1 0 0 1 48 248 Tm (   Avoid: Sending exhibits without a clear ask on the first page; Failing to keep delivery proof for the appeal packet) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 235 Tm (6. Confirm the outcome in writing [1-7 days after hearing or board action]) Tj
